1
00:00:00,138 --> 00:00:02,498
(Scanner:)Howard Wolowitz--
access granted.

2
00:00:02,811 --> 00:00:04,071
No way!
Impressive!

3
00:00:04,076 --> 00:00:05,906
Oh, my turn! My turn!

4
00:00:06,711 --> 00:00:08,811
(Scanner:)Leonard Hofstadter--
access granted.

5
00:00:08,814 --> 00:00:11,914
(Leonard:)I didn't even have
to take my glasses off!

6
00:00:15,320 --> 00:00:17,320
(Scanner(as Leonard and Sheldon try to fool it with one eye each):)Access denied.

7
00:00:17,322 --> 00:00:19,522
It knows!

8
00:00:27,517 --> 00:00:29,587
(Howard:)Oh, oh, oh, oh, guys,
hold me upside down!

9
00:00:38,204 --> 00:00:40,514
(Scanner:)Howard Wolowitz,
access granted.

10
00:00:40,511 --> 00:01:09,451
Yay!

